  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC Dropdowns package provides a comprehensive set of dropdown input controls including DropDownList, ComboBox, AutoComplete, MultiSelect, ListBox, DropDownTree, and Mention. These controls support data binding from local and remote data sources, virtualization for large datasets, grouping, filtering, templates, cascading dropdowns, checkbox selection, tagging, and accessibility. They are designed to deliver a rich and consistent selection experience in forms and data-driven ASP.NET MVC web applications.",
